{"id":"vod_bf_15558","vodId":"15558","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"剑勇传说","name_cn":"剑勇传说","date":"1993-01-01","year":"1993","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-16/0e4fd8721c03794a64ee1d19f68dec6b.jpg"},"summary":"铁剑（高山南 配音）奉父之命潜心钻研剑道，在比赛场上遇见了一生的宿敌鬼丸猛（堀川亮 配音），几番较量之下，鬼丸猛成为了铁剑的手下败将，不甘心的他被风神附体，得到了绝世珍宝风神剑。这边厢，铁剑亦得到了同样拥有强大力量的雷神剑，鬼丸猛一心想要夺走雷神剑，实现自己双剑合璧统治地球的野心，然而却总是不敌铁剑。　　在彻底粉碎了鬼丸猛的阴谋之后，铁剑和一干好友踏上了寻找龙珠的旅途，贼心不死的鬼丸猛自然要从中作梗，派出剑客，阻挠铁剑的队伍。最终，铁剑完成了目标，召唤出了神龙，哪知道神龙的出现使沉寂多年的香姬（深见梨加 配音）横空出世，世界再度落入了危险之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动画,冒险,喜,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 04:06:06","classic":true,"classicRank":41,"franchise":"龙珠","playable":true,"episodeCount":52,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianyongchuanshuo/第13集/index.m3u8"